    - rid: 2954408867173761031
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -5117498360985942581
          high: -4726250539372693251
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Orm
        text: Well? Go on, tell Hild the salt fish has come in.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 3274037854792712831
          high: 6029811905607383809
    - rid: 2954408867173761032
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: 7134157818277131895
          high: 3830938505066324853
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Orm
        text: Mind the planks, stranger. The boats are late again and this cart will not load itself.
        nextNodeId:
          low: -7125689632280292514
          high: -9104610580107238583
    - rid: 2954408867173761033
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -7125689632280292514
          high: -9104610580107238583
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        options:
        - text: What are you hauling?
          nextNodeId:
            low: 1959943380638440697
            high: -4644239985059623114
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: Do you need anything?
          nextNodeId:
            low: -1719893130401712152
            high: 6580966395541836575
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: Farewell.
          nextNodeId:
            low: 3274037854792712831
            high: 6029811905607383809
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
    - rid: 2954408867173761034
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: 1959943380638440697
          high: -4644239985059623114
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Orm
        text: Salt fish, mostly. It smells worse than it weighs, and it weighs plenty.
        nextNodeId:
          low: 3274037854792712831
          high: 6029811905607383809
    - rid: 2954408867173761035
      type: {class: LineNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -1719893130401712152
          high: 6580966395541836575
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        speakerName: Orm
        text: Strong backs, and an errand-runner. Hild at the alehouse wants the salt fish and does not know it has come in. Tell her, and I will make it worth your while.
        nextNodeId:
          low: -4955976555912098346
          high: -5676180456658417230
    - rid: 2954408867173761036
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: CRPG.Dialogue, asm: CRPG.Dialogue}
      data:
        nodeId:
          low: -4955976555912098346
          high: -5676180456658417230
        editorPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
        options:
        - text: I will tell her.
          nextNodeId:
            low: -4297537809772597316
            high: 7543062774017433092
          hasVisibilityCondition: 0
          timelineKey: 
          secondTimelineKey: 
          conditionType: 0
          threshold: 0
        - text: Not now.
